{"id":"6000c17a080be9b6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-system-binary-join.md","title":"两个 Cook–Reckhow 系统的带标签合并","display":"df-proof-system-binary-join — 两个 Cook–Reckhow 系统的带标签合并","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-system-binary-join","aliases":["72-df-proof-system-binary-join"],"display":"df-proof-system-binary-join — 两个 Cook–Reckhow 系统的带标签合并","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4, print549–552/PDF561–564; local finite-system construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"total function branches and source system interface checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-system-binary-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-system-binary-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-system-binary-join — 两个 Cook–Reckhow 系统的带标签合并"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII §§2.1,2.4, print549–552/PDF561–564; local finite-system construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"total function branches and source system interface checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P、Q 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a> 的 PropProofSystem，τ₀ 为其固定重言式，Σ={0,1}。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b^\\frown w\">\\(b^\\frown w\\)</span> 表示在二进制串 w 前加一个位 b；ε 是空串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(P\\sqcup Q)(\\varepsilon)&amp;:=\\tau_0,\\\\\n(P\\sqcup Q)(0^\\frown w)&amp;:=P(w),\\qquad\n(P\\sqcup Q)(1^\\frown w):=Q(w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(P\\sqcup Q)(\\varepsilon)&amp;:=\\tau_0,\\\\\n(P\\sqcup Q)(0^\\frown w)&amp;:=P(w),\\qquad\n(P\\sqcup Q)(1^\\frown w):=Q(w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空串和两个首位分支恰好覆盖全部串，且互斥。标签只增加一个位，不依赖判定被输出公式是否为重言式；可靠性来自两个给定系统。是普通有限合并，不是可有效枚举全部多项式证明系统的“通用最优系统”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"P、Q 满足 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]] 的 PropProofSystem，τ₀ 为其固定重言式，Σ={0,1}。$b^\\frown w$ 表示在二进制串 w 前加一个位 b；ε 是空串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"b^\\frown w","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(P\\sqcup Q)(\\varepsilon)&:=\\tau_0,\\\\\n(P\\sqcup Q)(0^\\frown w)&:=P(w),\\qquad\n(P\\sqcup Q)(1^\\frown w):=Q(w).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-540","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-535","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-bound-implies-optimal]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-simulates]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]] · [[72-df-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-df-polynomial-numeration]] · [[72-df-proof-system-binary-join]] · [[72-thm-each-finite-code-consistency]] · [[72-thm-finite-consistency-uniformity-gap]] · [